"The value of the `quarkus-dev-service-mongodb` label attached to the started "
"container. This property is used when `shared` is set to `true`. In this "
"case, before starting a container, Dev Services for MongoDB looks for a "
"container with the `quarkus-dev-service-mongodb` label set to the configured "
