"MONGODB-X509 mechanisms, no password is accepted, only the username. "
"Supported values: null or `GSSAPI++|++PLAIN++|++MONGODB-"
"X509++|++SCRAM_SHA_1++|++SCRAM_SHA_256++|++MONGODB_AWS`\n"
